\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Saviour, while my heart is tender,
\par I would yield that heart to Thee,
\par All my powers to Thee surrender,
\par Thine, and only  Thine, to be.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Take me now, Lord Jesus, take me;
\par Let my youthful heart be Thine;
\par Thy devoted servant make me;
\par Fill my  soul with love divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Send me, Lord, where Thou wilt 
\par send me,
\par Only do Thou guide my way;
\par May Thy grace through life attend me;
\par Gladly then shall I obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Let me do Thy will or bear it;
\par I would know no will but Thine:
\par Shouldst Thou take my life or
\par spare it,
\par I that life to Thee resign.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thine I am, O Lord, for ever,
\par To Thy service set apart;
\par Suffer me to leave Thee never,
\par Seal Thine image on my heart.
\par                                 Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

